{"id":"n69529-1-13","stage":0,"title":"이 · 牙齿","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69529-1-13-1","ko":"민준아, 밥 먹은 후에는 이를 꼭 닦으렴.","zh":"敏俊啊，吃完饭之后一定要刷牙哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"먹은","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹은","audio":"/audio/1d859792bc976ecdc401.mp3"}},{"text":"후에는","meaning":"后，以后，之后","explanation":"후：后，以后，之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후에는","audio":"/audio/299fa40b6fb5b686e98f.mp3"}},{"text":"이를","meaning":"牙齿","explanation":"이：牙齿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69529","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이를","audio":"/audio/562cf3d27ed8b18b9b83.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da